        },
        {
          "text": "“Inera kwanata EJAKAIT atiar: Kobwo kalaro naka etogo loka EJAKAIT, kolimok ireria kere luka Yuda, luepote aima togo loka EJAKAIT, akiro kere nukecorakini jo alimokin kes; sirikimunon adiokirot, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.26.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.26.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
