            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Aso do kitemonokis ikusirotin ka akusiswamisio, korimasi eporoto loka EJAKAIT Ekusideke; aso iitokini EJAKAIT ainyein aronis nakinerakinit yes. ",
          "type": "text",
