        },
        {
          "text": "“Abu Mikaia Emorasit kodwar kapaarasia nuka Kesekia ekabaka loka Yuda; kinera kituna kere luka Yuda, kobala ebe: ‘Inera kwanata EJAKAIT loka ajoresio atiar,",
