        },
        {
          "text": " Nakiiraria ekabaka Yekoiakim ka iketuŋa lukirigin kere ka ikapolok kere akekiro, kokoto ekabaka aiar ŋes: konye kiira Uria, kokurianar, koker, kolot Misiri, ",
